From aa18b74b81865d78fd64273d104d41bac3f9b5d3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SMARK <3222301373@qq.com>
Date: Thu, 21 May 2026 05:03:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: enhance dashboard rendering with new responsive layout
 and improved visualizations

- Introduced a new responsive sectioned overview for the dashboard, replacing the previous layout.
- Added detailed daily activity sections including calendar and hour-of-day visualizations.
- Implemented small multiples for token components, auto-normalized to their own peaks.
- Enhanced cost and health trends section with improved chart layouts.
- Updated tests to validate new rendering behavior and ensure no truncation occurs in dashboard rows.
- Ensured differentiated colors for session distribution to improve visual clarity.

